      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start the process, begin by selecting a filter and then applying it."
      ],
      "justification": "Initiates the process and splits the opening instruction into two equivalent sequential actions. Behaviour preserved."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After applying the filter, click on the Submit button."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly captures the button-click step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, check if the option to submit is set to \"false\""
      ],
      "justification": "Conditional check modeled as an action step feeding into an XOR branch. Acceptable re-typing per guidelines."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is, then apply another filter."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard captures the 'false' condition routing to the 'apply another filter' action. Logic preserved."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n8",
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the option to submit is set to \"true\", then continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard captures the 'true' condition routing to the continuation step. Logic preserved."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Additionally, check if there is another filter to apply."
      ],
      "justification": "Second conditional check modeled as action + XOR branch. Preserves decision point."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is, continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Positive branch of the second check correctly routed to continuation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n11",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Negative branch correctly routed to continuation. Converge node provides harmless structural plumbing to rejoin flows."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12",
        "guard:b3->n13",
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, if the option to submit is set to \"true\", continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Final check modeled as action + XOR branch + guard. True path continues the process as specified."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->e1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The process ends when all steps have been completed."
      ],
      "justification": "Implicit false path from final check routes to the end node. End node and converge align with process completion statement."
    }
